A note to anyone republishing: this guide teaches رواية حفص عن عاصم من طريق
الشاطبيّة. Rules genuinely differ between riwayat, and several points in the
text are disputed among scholars and are presented as disputed on purpose. If
you adapt it, please keep that nuance rather than flattening it — an
oversimplified ruling about the recitation of the Qur'an does real harm.
